{"title":"2003 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/4/534b3f0df3645892a3ad0c86a7fed487facdf749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, 4, 5, 6, and 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" /> are substituted, in some order, for the letters <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/0/5b06744c51bd44c42cee5e19514efd4908ae7447.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B, C, D, E, and F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"158\" height=\"18\" />, so that the number between and below two numbers is the positive difference between\nthose two numbers. For example, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the third row is the positive difference between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus D = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec86ff70586bed6b071e023ea265d5445cd6e5f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 - 2 = 7$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" />. The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/8/d581a78427d7276e7cc432cec35e7458344b3339.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A + C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" /> is\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/6/eb6ec12ea97eab29d50da85c63758e9f559a15d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 7 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 12 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 13 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 10 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the image:\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> are above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/e/ebe67650baacfae2e6a45ba8cd6aca2dbdd3ad4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A - 10 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed055a91edd3f92bfef0498e669e5dea6143e4e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 - A = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>This gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/6/3e6d4d316a96b2045f7f6656213c3bc62fdbdbe8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c961038c0307729c41af17b04fa3bd600e971527.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/6/3e6d4d316a96b2045f7f6656213c3bc62fdbdbe8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" /> is not one of the possible values listed in the original problem, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c961038c0307729c41af17b04fa3bd600e971527.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>We can use a similar process for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> (since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is not possible for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />) to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/b/a9bfa15db50677976d04e84d94bf86ca80c24d63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/b/a9bfa15db50677976d04e84d94bf86ca80c24d63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> then allows us to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/5/925a3e13e91ab5e100dc7e16f911ee6c9523e45b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> are above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/e/27eafbc6b227604e3fdc435dc9806839fadced95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> have all been used, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/9/cb965fa3d13afa8c4d948c8cd93b969f1d8097e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2003_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>We can now use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c961038c0307729c41af17b04fa3bd600e971527.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/9/cb965fa3d13afa8c4d948c8cd93b969f1d8097e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/7/cb7d82a8b328ebd6778315872a8dda9c8c071195.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A + C = 8 + 6 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 14}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"204\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017124908\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 156/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1510/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6908/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   10.083      1 -total\n 59.21%    5.970      5 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:32601:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017124908 and revision id 251686. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}